WEBVTT

00:40:28.058 --> 00:40:30.141
such as export control.

00:40:30.165 --> 00:40:34.395
And AI is completely
under the new rules coming out

00:40:34.419 --> 00:40:36.094
for export control.

00:40:36.118 --> 00:40:38.911
So how these two factors will play,

00:40:38.935 --> 00:40:40.300
I don't know.

00:40:40.608 --> 00:40:43.410
But I personally really don't think

00:40:43.434 --> 00:40:46.656
there have been that many
huge breakthroughs

00:40:46.680 --> 00:40:49.537
that can be made and protected,

00:40:49.561 --> 00:40:53.482
given the open-sharing
community that exists.

00:40:53.506 --> 00:40:56.958
And even just the existing
known algorithms

00:40:56.982 --> 00:41:00.686
can make a huge difference already
in China, US and elsewhere.